1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,540
Benny: Let me in! They're right behind me!

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:07,336
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part four of ten: the chicken.

3
00:00:07,656 --> 00:00:10,090
Rosa: Rule one. Nobody gets on.

4
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:12,356
Teddy: He's not nobody! He's Benny!

5
00:00:12,676 --> 00:00:14,438
Rosa: Fine. Chicken exception.

6
00:00:14,758 --> 00:00:15,593
Marcus: He's bleeding!

7
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:18,370
Dante: Bitten! Chicken guy! I called it!

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,110
Benny: No, no! It's not what it looks
like!

9
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:23,807
Priya: Nobody move. Let me see.

10
00:00:23,927 --> 00:00:28,518
Priya: Hmm. Sweet. Tomato. A little
vinegar.

11
00:00:28,838 --> 00:00:29,855
Dante: It's blood!

12
00:00:29,975 --> 00:00:30,729
Priya: It's ketchup.

13
00:00:31,049 --> 00:00:33,541
Benny: Three packets. They burst when I
ran.

14
00:00:33,661 --> 00:00:35,484
Marcus: Why do you carry ketchup in a
chicken suit?

15
00:00:35,604 --> 00:00:36,617
Benny: It's a work thing.

16
00:00:36,937 --> 00:00:39,471
Priya: Take the head off. I need to see
your neck.

17
00:00:39,591 --> 00:00:41,450
Benny: I can't. My manager will fire me.

18
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:43,960
Priya: Your manager is a zombie by now.

19
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:44,857
Benny: ...That's fair.

20
00:00:45,177 --> 00:00:48,024
Benny: I'm Benny. I'm nineteen. It's my
third shift.

21
00:00:48,344 --> 00:00:51,601
Priya: No bite. No fever. Just a lot of
sauce.

22
00:00:51,721 --> 00:00:52,474
Amara: Aww.

23
00:00:52,794 --> 00:00:57,788
BUS-E: Fun fact: the driver's seat is
thirty-nine degrees. The heater is off. Cozy!

24
00:00:58,108 --> 00:00:59,131
Rosa: Hot flash.

25
00:00:59,251 --> 00:00:59,728
Priya: ...Right.

26
00:01:00,048 --> 00:01:02,222
Dante: Statistically, one of us is lying.

27
00:01:02,542 --> 00:01:09,524
BUS-E: Part four of ten, The Last Bus. Next:
the sleeve check. Follow for part five. Wash your wings.

